# D10(a) NEGATIVE (decisions.md, ratified 2026-07-06): a module-level static
# initialized with a mutable borrow (`Vector[int] G = &BASE`) is the same
# named-`&`-bind class as the local forms — rejected.
# Expected: error[E_LocalBorrowBind] at the `&BASE` initializer.
Vector[int] BASE = [1, 2, 3]
Vector[int] G = &BASE

void main():
    print(G.len())
